# The firmware tree tracks code only.
#
# Upstream's bulk binary assets - the full printable STL set, the original
# wiring diagrams, the MP3s, the photos and the parts list - are large
# (~212MB) and unchanged from upstream, so they are deliberately not tracked.
# Get them from the upstream project if you need them:
#
#   https://github.com/cguweb-com/Arduino-Projects/tree/main/Nova-SM3
#
# The curated hardware documentation for THIS fork - my modified CAD, the
# before/after comparison figures and the build photography - lives under
# hardware/ and IS tracked. See hardware/cad/README.md.
#
Nova-SM3/STL Files/
Nova-SM3/Wiring/
Nova-SM3/MP3/
Nova-SM3/Remote Control/
Nova-SM3/*.jpg
Nova-SM3/*.png
Nova-SM3/*.psd
Nova-SM3/*.xlsx
Nova-SM3/*.html
Nova-SM3/README.md

# Arduino build output
build/
*.hex
*.elf
